<<set $Minutes += 10>>
You move to the edge of the woods carefully, peeking out over the dimly lit streets as you try to come up with some sort of plan to get home without being spotted. <span style="color:Yellow">You may only be a few streets over, but the residential district doesn’t have many places for you to hide and the array of streetlights will spotlight your exposed body as you run. The only good news is, since it’s still dark out, you expect most people to still be asleep.</span> <br>

