    <span style="color:Pink">You take a step back and glance down, your nude body trembling in the open air without even a thread of clothing. You gulp and cover your crotch with your hands, though that does very little to ease your embarrassment. Being stuck outside naked so far from home leaves you feeling extremely vulnerable.</span> <br>
    <br>
