    <span style="color:Pink">You shuffle back further, your exposed body burning more and more as she gets closer. If she checks under the car, you’re done for. Stuck and exposed in front of this random old lady. Will she scream? Sending neighbors running to help? Will she call for the police, leaving you exposed and defenseless in some jailcell like this!? You begin to panic, you need to think of some way out of this situation!</span> <br>
